This repository is intended for human-generatod (instead of
ocamldoc-generated) documentation on the prototype and the underlying
theory.

It is difficult to keep the code and the theory in sync, as they tend
to evolve separately (and a theory change may be slow to repercute
into a clean code change). By including here informal description of
the theory directly inside the source, it is believed that
desynchronization may be avoided.

Due to lazyness on my (Gabriel Scherer) part, most of the documents
are written in french. Please do not hesitate to ask for
translations/clarifications if you need it ( gabriel dot scherer at
gmail ).
